      "attack_scenario": "A user who was removed from the Discord server retains a valid Supabase session; they are blocked from dashboard UI pages but can directly POST to server action endpoints (e.g., attendance recording in actions.ts) using their session cookie, performing operations without passing the Discord membership gate.",
